    <link rel="enclosure" href="https://github.com/y1-community/updater-ce-neo/releases/download/2.5.3/installer.exe" title="installer.exe" length="148283609" type="application/x-msdownload" innioasis:download_count="61" innioasis:asset_id="722045299"/>
    <link rel="enclosure" href="https://github.com/y1-community/updater-ce-neo/releases/download/2.5.3/UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip" title="UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip" length="205854850" type="application/x-zip-compressed" innioasis:download_count="55" innioasis:asset_id="722052315"/>
    <link rel="enclosure" href="https://github.com/y1-community/updater-ce-neo/releases/download/2.5.3/Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.dmg" title="Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.dmg" length="119787348" type="application/x-diskcopy" innioasis:download_count="5" innioasis:asset_id="724630592"/>
    <content type="text">In this release changes include:

Keep Settings and Media - Retains your player&#x27;s settings and personal files/media where the firmware you&#x27;re installing is compatible with your existing firmware*

Support for firmware installs with post-setup instructions - useful for
Our newly added support for installing Y2Reborn and Rondo! (Mac and Linux users rejoice!)
Improved guidance shown during firmware installs
Better error handling and troubleshooting guidance
i18n fixes
Support for the full Innioasis and Timmkoo product line in Updater CE and Firmware Archive.

*Where two firmwares are compatible with eachother, for example if coming from the original software to a newer version of the original software, or a mod of it like Better-Y or Koensayr</content>
